Text1 uploadallinstructionpanel/title
Welcome to Batch Upload

Text1 uploadallinstructionpanel/body
Check the boxes next to the folders and albums you'd like to work with. Then, pick what you'd like to do. Picasa will filter the items where the operation wouldn't apply. For example, if an entire folder or album is already online, Picasa won't show it as an option to upload.